olimits^I_{I'}(I, \mathcal{O}(I))\longrightarrow (I, \mathcal{O}(I)). \] \item[(b)] For a triple of composable embeddings $I''\hookrightarrow I'\hookrightarrow I$ we have a canonical isomorphism \[ \operatorname{Res}
olimits^I_{I''} \,\,\cong \,\, \operatorname{Res}
olimits^{I'}_{I''}\circ \operatorname{Res}
olimits^I_{I'}. \] \end{itemize}

